  "canonical_path": "docs/json/governance/mission-envelope.v1.json",
  "render": {
    "toc": true,
    "search_index": true
  },
  "sections": [
    {
      "block_id": "h1-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": "Mission Envelope",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The mission envelope is the minimal executable bridge object between governance intent and agent runtime context.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "It exists so the harness can run a governed mission without requiring a full ADR → Sprint → Mission orchestration tree in the executable path.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-4",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Purpose",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- Provide a concrete runtime object for a single mission run. - Carry the minimum stable metadata needed for context packet compilation. - Keep ADR and sprint information optional until the orchestration hierarchy is fully executable.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-6",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Core Fields",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- `mission_id` - `title` - optional `adr_id` - optional `sprint_id` - `repo_root` - `branch` - `head` - `dirty_status_fingerprint` or `dirty_file_summary` - `allowed_paths` - `protected_paths` - `instruction_paths` - `acceptance_checks` - `handoff_required` - `created_at` - `schema_version`",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-8",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Governance Reference",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The envelope may carry optional governance metadata:",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "code-10",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "json",
      "content": "{\n  \"governance_ref\": {\n    \"adr_id\": null,\n    \"sprint_id\": null,\n    \"mission_id\": \"mission-...\"\n  }\n}",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "detailed",
        "collapsible": true,
        "collapsed_by_default": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The key rule is that mission-only mode must work now, and ADR/sprint metadata can be attached later without changing `mission_id`.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-12",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Design Rules",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- The envelope must be deterministic to serialize. - The envelope must reject unknown fields. - The envelope must not contain raw file bodies, raw prompts, raw stdout/stderr, or secrets. - The envelope should compile from existing state: AGENTS.md, git status, branch/HEAD, dirty inventory, mission prompt, path policy, validation commands, and optional handoff text. - Receipts should come before retrieval. Reproducibility first, intelligence later.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-14",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Bridge Relationship",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "This envelope is the bridge between:",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- current task execution - runtime context resolution - future ADR/Sprint/Mission orchestration",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "It is intentionally smaller than the full governance hierarchy.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Executable contract: - `rig_relay.governance.mission_envelope.MissionEnvelope` - `docs/schemas/rig.mission_envelope.v1.schema.json`",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "See also: - `rig_relay.governance.mission_context_packet.MissionContextPacket` - `docs/governance/mission-context-packets.md`",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    }
  ],
